      * SNIPPET FOR UNDERSTANDING TABLE IN COBOL
      * COMPRENDRE LA MAGIE DE DONNEE DE TABLEAU ET DE SA LIGNE BIS
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TABLE-TEST14.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      * Variables de travail pour le test
       01  TEST-LINE.
           05 TEST-LINE-STRING         PIC X(5)  OCCURS 3 TIMES
           ASCENDING KEY IS TEST-LINE-STRING  
           INDEXED BY PL-IDX.
           05 TEST-LINE-INTEGER      PIC 9(02) VALUE 50.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE "TOTO1" TO TEST-LINE-STRING (1).
           MOVE "TOTO2" TO TEST-LINE-STRING (2).
           MOVE "TOTO3" TO TEST-LINE-STRING (3).
           MOVE 51 TO   TEST-LINE-INTEGER.

           DISPLAY "TEST-LINE.".
           DISPLAY TEST-LINE.